{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Build towers, grow crops, and defend your farm against a mad scientist\u2019s undead army.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u> </u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong><u>Chiki</u></strong>, a tiny but fearless chicken tasked with defending the barn while the farmer is away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Build Towers</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/Screenshot_2025-05-15_at_8.12.27\u202fPM.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker__1_.gif?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a <u><strong>variety of towers</strong></u>, some shoot fast, other pierce armor, while some deal AOE damage or freeze enemies. Each tower has a unique role. Upgrade and combine their effects to create powerful synergies, and amplify them further with specialized Tesla towers to build an unstoppable defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Grow Crops</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/crop-sprinkler-cropped.gif?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Plant crops</u></strong> to earn coins at the end of each round and upgrade them with nearby sprinklers. Work your way up to cabbages, the most valuable crop, and optimize your placements to maximize profits from every tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Analyze the battlefield</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/img-xray.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See through the chaos with <strong><u>X-ray</u></strong> vision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Plan your defense</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/Sprite-0020.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place your defenses to counter a variety of enemy types, some charge headfirst, others are heavily armored, and each comes with its own unique behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to stop a mad scientist on a quest for world domination?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>About me</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi, I\u2019m the solo developer behind <strong>Guardian Chicken</strong>, a quirky little tower defense game I\u2019ve been building over the past few months in my spare time. I\u2019ve poured a lot of love and soul into this project, and I truly hope it\u2019s just as fun for you to play as it was for me to create :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ll be releasing a demo soon with a handful of levels to try out. And following are the things planned for the full release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple visual themes to keep things fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New tower types with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A funny, dialogue-rich storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels and infinite wave modes (still experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And plenty more things!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Credits</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was made possible thanks to incredible free assets found online</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Development</strong>: Written in C using raylib</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music:\u00a0</strong>Background music by <i>Aila Scott</i> (not\u00a0affiliated, source: itch.io)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Font</strong>: <i>Kitchen Sink</i> (source: itch.io)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For a full list of all assets used in the game, please visit the GitHub credits page</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734000?t=1748691475","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/2d8e978ca9680c99067ea0b2f4e7905b2b8cf683/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748691475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/a4aa2c285c262389ddfeafc1acd018708f79b851/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748691475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/a4aa2c285c262389ddfeafc1acd018708f79b851/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748691475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Build towers, grow crops, and defend your farm against a mad scientist\u2019s undead army.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u> </u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong><u>Chiki</u></strong>, a tiny but fearless chicken tasked with defending the barn while the farmer is away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Build Towers</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/Screenshot_2025-05-15_at_8.12.27\u202fPM.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker__1_.gif?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build a <u><strong>variety of towers</strong></u>, some shoot fast, other pierce armor, while some deal AOE damage or freeze enemies. Each tower has a unique role. Upgrade and combine their effects to create powerful synergies, and amplify them further with specialized Tesla towers to build an unstoppable defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Grow Crops</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/crop-sprinkler-cropped.gif?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Plant crops</u></strong> to earn coins at the end of each round and upgrade them with nearby sprinklers. Work your way up to cabbages, the most valuable crop, and optimize your placements to maximize profits from every tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Analyze the battlefield</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/img-xray.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See through the chaos with <strong><u>X-ray</u></strong> vision!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Plan your defense</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/Sprite-0020.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place your defenses to counter a variety of enemy types, some charge headfirst, others are heavily armored, and each comes with its own unique behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to stop a mad scientist on a quest for world domination?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/extras/steam_page_break-export.png?t=1748691475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>About me</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi, I\u2019m the solo developer behind <strong>Guardian Chicken</strong>, a quirky little tower defense game I\u2019ve been building over the past few months in my spare time. I\u2019ve poured a lot of love and soul into this project, and I truly hope it\u2019s just as fun for you to play as it was for me to create :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I\u2019ll be releasing a demo soon with a handful of levels to try out. And following are the things planned for the full release:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple visual themes to keep things fresh</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New tower types with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A funny, dialogue-rich storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels and infinite wave modes (still experimental)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And plenty more things!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Credits</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game was made possible thanks to incredible free assets found online</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Development</strong>: Written in C using raylib</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Music:\u00a0</strong>Background music by <i>Aila Scott</i> (not\u00a0affiliated, source: itch.io)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Font</strong>: <i>Kitchen Sink</i> (source: itch.io)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For a full list of all assets used in the game, please visit the GitHub credits page</p></li></ul>","developers":["bones-dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734000/6c3f08b934e3cb2f5e440cbea5ccf313bf101165/header.jpg?t=1748691475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257148820,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148820/movie480.mp4?t=1748683831","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148820/movie_max.mp4?t=1748683831"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257148820/afe4d4bd34367963a6aac8cdc690d8f330d186b0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748683831","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148820/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748683831","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257148820/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748683831"}}],"name":"Guardian Chicken","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><